52:- ✅ Renewed explanation approval when product scope changes.
56:- ✅ Durable stage/session identity, artifact revisions, attempts, and approval provenance.
71:- ❌ Legacy workflow tools, ordinary-chat approval transport, old-state migration, or compatibility shims.
73:- ❌ User approval of issue granularity or a second approval immediately before execution.
